# Build pages

- Use `BuildShell` (`src/components/build-shell.tsx`) for every experiment/build route.
- Title + description at the **top** (centered).
- Interactive build content vertically + horizontally centered in the **middle** of the viewport.
- Top-left back pill → home. No logo on build pages.
- Metadata titles use hyphen separator: `%s - buildwithduy`.
